<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-North Flinders year net profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-North Flinders year net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   56.96  vs  53.92</p>
<p>    Net				    38.52  vs  34.65</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	   25.0   vs  25.0</p>
<p>NOTE: North Flinders Mines Ltd, a gold miner, is 75 percent owned by Normandy Mining Ltd.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	    40.0  vs  40.0</p>
<p>    Sales				  138.91 vs 132.54</p>
<p>    Other income			   1.04 vs   4.06</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   51.9  vs  46.8</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			 nil  vs   nil</p>
<p>Dividend is 25 pct franked</p>
<p>Pay date Sep 9</p>
<p>Reg date Sep 1</p>
<p>    Tax				     18.44 vs  19.27</p>
<p>    Interest				 nil  vs   nil</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  11.29 vs  12.50</p>
<p>    Minorities			     nil  vs   nil</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
